@page "/privacy"
@attribute [AllowAnonymous]

<MudText Typo="Typo.h4" GutterBottom="true">Privacy Policy</MudText>

<MudText Typo="Typo.body2" Class="mb-4"><em>Care Coordination</em> is a private, invite-only app used by one family's caregiving team. It is not a public service, and this policy covers only that closed group.</MudText>

<MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="mt-4 mb-1">What we collect</MudText>
<MudText Class="mb-4">
    Your name, email address, and (optionally) a mobile phone number, provided directly by you when
    accepting an invitation or later in your account settings. Care shift, note, and document
    activity you and other invited members create while using the app.
</MudText>

<MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="mt-4 mb-1">How it's used</MudText>
<MudText Class="mb-4">
    Solely to run the shared caregiving schedule: showing shifts, notes, and documents to your care
    team, and sending you notifications about shift assignments, replacement requests, and document
    uploads by email and, if you've provided a number, by SMS. We do not use your information for
    advertising, and we do not sell or share it with third parties, other than the email and SMS
    providers strictly needed to deliver those notifications.
</MudText>

<MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="mt-4 mb-1">SMS messages</MudText>
<MudText Class="mb-4">
    Providing a phone number is optional and is only used to send you the same caregiving
    notifications described above. Message frequency varies with your care team's shift activity;
    message and data rates may apply. You can stop SMS notifications at any time by removing your
    phone number from your account settings, or by replying STOP. Reply HELP for help.
</MudText>

<MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="mt-4 mb-1">Data storage</MudText>
<MudText Class="mb-4">
    This app is self-hosted by your care team's administrator. Data is stored on that
    administrator's own infrastructure, not shared with any analytics or advertising company.
</MudText>

<MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="mt-4 mb-1">Questions</MudText>
<MudText>
    Contact the administrator who invited you to this app with any questions about your data.
</MudText>
